  "packageSize": 185726,
  "published": "2026-10-05T01:34:32.81Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixed Bind not binding any column. Row, QueryOutput and Query now compare by value instead of by reference. Duplicate column names in a result throw DuplicateColumnNameException, which names the column. Column names can be made case-insensitive with ColumnNameComparer. Async methods no longer need the caller's synchronization context, so blocking on them can't deadlock, and the sync methods rethrow an async callback's own exception. A transaction with no queries no longer opens a connection. Added net9.0 and net10.0 targets.",
